Guidelines for AI: Knowing When to Respond

Scenario	AI Action	Reasoning
Direct Question or Request	Respond immediately	User is clearly engaging with AI for help or information.
Clear Command or Instruction	Execute or reply	AI is being given a task or prompt.
User in Personal Conversation	Stay silent	Avoid interrupting when the user is talking to others.
Background Chatter or Noise	Stay silent	AI should not assume the conversation is directed at it.
Indistinct or Half-Speaking	Wait for clarification	Only respond when the user explicitly addresses the AI.
Key Difference:
	⁃	AI responds only to explicit, direct communication.
	⁃	AI stays silent during personal conversations, group discussions, or background talk.

This behavior ensures AI interacts appropriately without interrupting or intruding on private communication.
